	('5b9bfea2-cf63-4392-a363-995f0b711c64', '71c61571-eec3-43d5-83f7-fc772b176b84', 'Research-L – AI-Based Research Assistan', 'Research-L is an AI-powered multi-agent system that automates literature review, research-gap identification, and hypothesis generation. It retrieves academic papers, extracts findings and limitations, and uses RAG and LLMs to generate evidence-grounded research insights. The system also validates hypotheses for novelty, feasibility, and groundedness and can generate publication-formatted research papers.', 'ongoing', NULL, NULL, '', '{"Python
