	('a94d9b6b-1e14-41c7-a4fb-ef6dfae7a54e', '102993cd-9a16-4e51-97b7-fb73f039bdfb', 'A DATA DRIVEN ANALYSIS OF UX/UI FACTORS OF MAJOR  UPI APPLICATIONS', 'My project is about studying the UX (User Experience) and UI (User Interface) of major UPI applications such as PhonePe, Google Pay, and Paytm. The main aim is to understand how the design, ease of payment, navigation, readability, security, and other features affect users’ satisfaction and usage. For this study, data was collected from 54 respondents through a questionnaire and analysed using percentages, tables, and charts. The study found that most users find UPI apps easy to use, while some users face difficulties with navigation, complex interfaces, and security concerns. Overall, the project shows that simple design, easy navigation, clear information, and better security can improve the user experience of UPI applications.', 'ongoing', NULL, '2026-04-29', '', '{"Google Forms – Data collection
MS Excel – Data analysis
Percentage Analysis – Analysing responses
